<title>USA: Crane Co closes Interpoint Corp acquisition.</title>
<headline>Crane Co closes Interpoint Corp acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crane Co said on Wednesday that it had closed its $59 million acquisition of microelectronics company Interpoint Corp.</p>
<p>Crane, an engineered industrial products maker, said it issued about 730,000 shares of its common stock in the tax-free merger.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
